  unitName: Logi (Omni)
  unitId: 850978
  unitNumber: 8365
  description: A knight from the distant world of Envylia. Logi tried to quell a
    rebellion planned by the remnants of Wratharis, a neighbouring country that was
    ruined some 20 years ago. Curiously, amidst his efforts to quench the rebellion
    alongside his friend Dias, he experienced a most unexpected encounter with the
    enemy. Cornered by the rebels who seem to wield the forbidden power of Alchemy,
    Logi somehow gains this power himself upon a fateful meeting with a strange young
    girl. With this taboo ability now at his disposal, Logi plans to continue fighting
    to protect the world.
  summonDesc: I wonder if you and I will ever<br>share an unbreakable bond...<br>No,
    I'm sure we will!
  fusionDesc: I want power...<br>Power to protect this world!
  evoDesc: I wonder if it's too much to ask for a world where we can understand each
    other...
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
